13:43.910 --> 13:44.910
Awak iri hati tak?

13:45.630 --> 13:46.830
Nak jadi popular tak?

13:47.300 --> 13:49.340
Awak berusahalah.

13:49.480 --> 13:50.870
Saya suruh awak berpakaian cantik,

13:50.870 --> 13:52.440
